          "python",
          "=== A/B Test Results (14-day experiment) ===\n\nUsers per group: 5000\nTest duration: 14 days\n\nMetric                      Control  Treatment     Lift    p-value  Significant\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClick-Through Rate           0.0500     0.0549    +9.8%     0.0001      Yes ***\nWatch Time (min)            24.9823    26.9145    +7.7%     0.0000      Yes ***\nRetention Rate               0.7012     0.7188    +2.5%     0.0523          No"
        ]
      ]
